00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:17.960
At 8.15 in the morning of August 6th Japanese time, the first atomic bomb hit an enemy target.

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:26.060
The bomb was aimed to explode above zero point, a spot in the city at the junction of the Motoyisu and Ota River.

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:29.960
